      "positive": "Publisher 886 EARS-WHAM v2 pairs: hybrid48 real-time parallel streams 56 vs DPDFNet2 HR 17.3; fast8 ESTOI 0.72 vs noisy 0.64, PESQ-NB 2.28 vs 1.85, SI-SDR 10.99 vs 5.32 dB.",
