      "reason": "Distinct 8kHz narrowband and 48kHz hybrid neural speech restoration complements ASR, diarization and music transcription; not a format duplicate. Concurrent selection already adopted identical revision; no second formal row.",
      "limitations": "Preserve original audio; generative restoration may alter speech. TFLite format duplicate, quality48 held. Exact learned totals, C++17/ORT SDK ABI, code allowlist, dependency and owner rights unresolved.",
